1
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,502
Meet Vesopa Go.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:11,121
Your whole till, right in your pocket. Orders and payments, on any Android phone.

3
00:00:11,721 --> 00:00:19,362
Your menu. Your tables. The kitchen. Allergens. And payments. All in one place.

4
00:00:19,862 --> 00:00:22,109
Take the order, right at the table.

5
00:00:22,962 --> 00:00:26,761
And before you're back at the bar, it's already in the kitchen.

6
00:00:27,211 --> 00:00:30,141
Add the drinks. Then tap Pay.

7
00:00:30,541 --> 00:00:35,248
Cash. Card. Tap to Pay. Or QR. However your guests like to pay.

8
00:00:35,648 --> 00:00:40,331
With QR Pay, they simply scan, pay, and go.

9
00:00:40,731 --> 00:00:44,970
Paid! And the receipt is printed, or emailed, in one tap.

10
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:51,176
Use it on Android phones, on the Dojo Pocket, and on Android tablets.

11
00:00:51,876 --> 00:00:54,589
Work faster. Serve more.

12
00:00:56,076 --> 00:01:02,405
Quicker service. Bigger orders. Happier guests. And a team that's always in step.

13
00:01:02,905 --> 00:01:07,632
Get Vesopa Go on Google Play, or visit go.vesopa.com.

14
00:01:08,232 --> 00:01:12,062
Vesopa Go. Orders and payments, anywhere.
